{
  "source": "Hand-written from the event shapes in https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock/latest/APIReference/API_runtime_ConverseStream.html and https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock/latest/userguide/conversation-inference.html (read 2026-10-11). Not recorded from a real inference call.",
  "description": "The model runs into maxTokens: the text stops mid-sentence and stopReason says so.",
